msgid "As a precaution, following plugins have been deactivated. You must check for plugins upgrade before reactiving them:"
msgstr "Kot previdnostni ukrep so sledeči vtičniki onemogočeni. Preveriti morate posodobitve za te vtičnike in jih nato ponovno omogočiti:"

msgid "Only thumbnails prefix and webmaster mail address have been saved from previous configuration"
msgstr "Od predhodnje nastavitve so shranjene le predpone sličic in e-poštni naslov skrbnika spletne strani"

msgid "Perform a maintenance check in [Administration>Tools>Maintenance] if you encounter any problem."
msgstr "V primeru težav naredite vzdrževalno preverjanje preko [Administracija>Orodja>Vzdrževanje]"

msgid "SQL queries"
msgstr "SQL poizvedbe"

msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Statistika"

msgid "This page proposes to upgrade your database corresponding to your old version of Piwigo to the current version. The upgrade assistant thinks you are currently running a <strong>release %s</strong> (or equivalent)."
msgstr "Ta stran predlaga, da nadgradite podatkovno bazo vaše Piwigo različice na novejšo različico. Čarovnik nadgradnje je zaznal, da trenutno uporabljate <strong>različico %s</strong> (ali enakovredno)."

msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Nadgradi"

msgid "Upgrade from version %s to %s"
msgstr "Nadgradi iz različice %s na različico %s"

msgid "Upgrade informations"
msgstr "Povzetek posodobitve"

msgid "User permissions and group permissions have been erased"
msgstr "Dovoljenja uporabnikov in skupin so bila izbrisana"

msgid "You do not have access rights to run upgrade"
msgstr "Nimate dovoljenja za izvedbo nadgradnje"

msgid "total SQL time"
msgstr "skupen SQL čas"

msgid "total upgrade time"
msgstr "skupen čas nadgradnje"

msgid "In <i>%s</i>, before <b>?></b>, insert:"
msgstr "V <i>%s</i>, pred <b>?></b>, vstavi:"

msgid "Only administrator can run upgrade: please sign in below."
msgstr "Nadgradnjo lahko opravi le Administrator. Prosimo prijavite se spodaj:"

msgid "As a precaution, following themes have been deactivated. You must check for themes upgrade before reactiving them:"
msgstr "Kot previdnostni ukrep so sledeče preobleke onemogočene. Preveriti morate posodobitve za te preobleke in jih nato ponovno omogočiti:"

msgid "All sub-albums of private albums become private"
msgstr "Vsi pod-albumi zasebnega albuma postanejo zasebni"

msgid "Discover what's new in Piwigo %s"
msgstr "Odkrijte, kaj je novega v Piwigo %s"

